    "number": 117,
    "title": "Synchronize Pixoo dashboard renderer delivery in the work guide",
    "body": "Companion to [Pixoo PR #63](https://github.com/jimmie-potts/divoom-app-upgrade/pull/63), delivering Pixoo issue #32.\n\nRecord the dashboard renderer as a source-review candidate, refresh backlog inputs, and preserve the physical qualification facts from Hub PR #116. The guide keeps #33's monitor panel/writer integration and #34's integrated acceptance separate. Source merge/closure and architecture-source reconciliation will be added after those facts are verified.\n\nLocal guide build, all five maintenance tests, desktop/mobile/print browser checks and committed-output reproducibility passed. The guide covers 102 open issues in 12 guides with nine unchanged architecture viewers. Only docs/work-guide paths changed; configured CI filtering must be verified against the final comparison. Independent reviews remain pending. Public publication is outside this source-only task.\n",
    "state": "open",
